<section class="relative flex min-h-screen items-center justify-center bg-background px-8">
  <div class="max-w-3xl">
    <p class="mb-4 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-muted-foreground">Why now</p>
    <h2 class="text-balance text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-5xl">
      A timing thesis lives here.
    </h2>
    <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-lg text-muted-foreground">
      <li class="border-l-2 border-primary/40 pl-4">First reason this is interesting now, not later.</li>
      <li class="border-l-2 border-primary/40 pl-4">Second reason — usually a market or behavior shift.</li>
      <li class="border-l-2 border-primary/40 pl-4">Third reason — a window that closes.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
